# The ONE FFmpeg every app in the family builds against (canon row 187). Point releases move by editing this file;
# a major moves by ruling (the API assessment of 2026-11-07: 123 symbols in use, none deprecated in 9.0.2).
FFMPEG_VERSION=9.0.2
# macOS: built from source with the three local patches (tools/ffmpeg/patches — QCView's: DNxHR 444 ACT, MXF RGBA range, ProRes RAW
# Bayer) by tools/ffmpeg/build-macos.sh into the gitignored external/ffmpeg/macos-arm64; .cargo/config.toml puts its pkgconfig
# ahead of Homebrew's (2026-11-08: Homebrew's stock build decoded Avid DNxHR 444 as yuv444p12le — the speckle). Homebrew's
# `ffmpeg` CLI stays for the tests' fixture generation.
MACOS_SOURCE=source-patched
# macOS SRT (the live srt:// input, canon row 227 2a — QCView-Player dependencies.md: libsrt + mbedTLS vendored static): built by
# build-macos.sh into external/ffmpeg/deps-macos-arm64 and linked into libavformat. mbedTLS = the release TARBALL (git needs a
# submodule + Python codegen). Windows' BtbN recipe already enables libsrt.
SRT_VERSION=1.5.6
MBEDTLS_VERSION=3.6.7
# Windows: BtbN's gpl-shared RECIPE built with the three patches (tools/ffmpeg/build-win64-wsl.sh, 2026-11-08) — same source as
# the stock asset below (n9.0.2-48-gd4070a14ce), patched; the zip is self-built, not downloadable: it lives on rhombus
# (C:\qcb-lab\…-patched.zip) and its hash is PATCHED_SHA256. fetch-win64.ps1 fetches the STOCK zip (no patches) — a fallback only. (Vulkan + libplacebo on, so the ProRes Vulkan hwaccel is present; d3d12va too).
# Pinned to the DATED release asset — BtbN's `latest` asset is re-zipped daily and its sha256 drifts.
WIN64_BUILD=n9.0.2-48-gd4070a14ce-20261107
WIN64_TAG=autobuild-2026-11-07-12-47
WIN64_URL=https://github.com/BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds/releases/download/autobuild-2026-11-07-12-47/ffmpeg-n9.0.2-48-gd4070a14ce-win64-gpl-shared-9.0.zip
WIN64_SHA256=43F3DA864A1BDFC89926FA250183593C301CED599F22AD5BFCB3D18D45CAEB3F
WIN64_BYTES=85978068
PATCHED_ZIP=ffmpeg-n9.0.2-48-gd4070a14ce-win64-gpl-shared-9.0-patched.zip
PATCHED_SHA256=DAE4CA804534BCEA6702E7408A70450AB0232CF46BD0636A9DFA924957DA0B99
PATCHED_BYTES=85884850
